1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,320
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,060
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:18,020
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:22,260
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:27,820
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,500
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:35,140
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:39,220
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:44,340
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:48,780
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:51,780
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:58,180
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:02,460
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:08,860
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:15,620
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:18,580
=Episode 12=

17
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:21,319
(Loyalty Hall)

18
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:23,200
Back up! Back up!

19
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:24,519
Boss Liu.

20
00:01:25,599 --> 00:01:26,480
Sorry.

21
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:29,640
From shipping to distribution,

22
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:31,000
the jewelry passed through many hands.

23
00:01:31,799 --> 00:01:33,400
Everyone here knows that.

24
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:34,840
Those drugs

25
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:37,200
could've been planted by anyone.

26
00:01:37,799 --> 00:01:38,920
Why pin this on Boss Hui?

27
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:40,879
Exactly.

28
00:01:42,359 --> 00:01:43,760
You say Boss Hai died

29
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,400
because he saw Boss Hui moving drugs.

30
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,719
Why didn't you say that when he died?

31
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,799
Or when we investigated Nanhu Gang?

32
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:51,159
Why wait until now?

33
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,640
Because I investigated it

34
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,840
and only found this evidence now.

35
00:01:54,959 --> 00:01:55,400
Fei Liu.

36
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:57,920
You can't claim the drugs are mine

37
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,079
whenever it suits you,

38
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,879
then call these Boss Hai's belongings.

39
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:04,120
All based on your word?

40
00:02:04,599 --> 00:02:05,359
What are you implying?

41
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,000
This is evidence.

42
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,840
You can say whatever you want.

43
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,479
What's the problem?

44
00:02:15,439 --> 00:02:16,319
Enough. Quiet!

45
00:02:16,879 --> 00:02:17,719
You've been arguing

46
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:18,960
all this time,

47
00:02:19,199 --> 00:02:19,879
and we're getting nowhere.

48
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:21,080
Fei Liu.

49
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,759
Do you have any new evidence?

50
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:24,919
Fine.

51
00:02:26,439 --> 00:02:27,919
You've all seen
Boss Hai's severed finger,

52
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,759
right?

53
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:33,560
The severed edge

54
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,240
wasn't cut by a blade.

55
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:38,280
It looked like an animal

56
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:39,360
had gnawed on it.

57
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:40,719
Hui.

58
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:44,319
You have a pig farm outside the city,

59
00:02:44,599 --> 00:02:45,080
don't you?

60
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:47,400
What are you getting at?

61
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:49,240
Boss Hai's death

62
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,319
hit all of us

63
00:02:51,319 --> 00:02:52,639
hard.

64
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,240
We've spent months

65
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:56,520
looking into it.

66
00:02:58,639 --> 00:03:00,879
And I finally found a lead.

67
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,000
Before Boss Hai

68
00:03:03,639 --> 00:03:04,479
died,

69
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,840
he was at

70
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:08,680
your pig farm.

71
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:10,840
A pig farm?

72
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,039
I have a chicken farm too. So what?

73
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,520
Everyone.

74
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,120
At this point,

75
00:03:20,639 --> 00:03:21,719
we could keep arguing

76
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:24,439
until tomorrow and get nowhere.

77
00:03:26,199 --> 00:03:28,000
I know what Boss Hui is like.

78
00:03:29,319 --> 00:03:30,159
I stand by him.

79
00:03:30,479 --> 00:03:33,400
But Boss Liu has evidence too.

80
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,719
We're all on the same side.

81
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:38,039
We shouldn't let this turn into a feud

82
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,400
over a misunderstanding.

83
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,039
Boss Yong.

84
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:43,719
I have a suggestion.

85
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:47,080
Boss Hui's pig farm

86
00:03:47,599 --> 00:03:49,080
has been shut for a while.

87
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:50,840
Each headquarters can send some men

88
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,560
to search it together.

89
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,360
If we find nothing,

90
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:57,960
I'll personally host a banquet

91
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:00,400
to make amends to you, Boss Hui.

92
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,280
I'll apologize.

93
00:04:01,879 --> 00:04:02,599
After all,

94
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:05,080
Boss Liu was only trying to help me.

95
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,360
Boss Hui.

96
00:04:12,479 --> 00:04:13,360
You don't mind, do you?

97
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,519
Boss Hui.

98
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,279
Quick, quick!

99
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,000
Come on.

100
00:04:24,199 --> 00:04:24,720
This way.

101
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,560
You guys, go this way.

102
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,720
You, over here.

103
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:28,439
Okay.

104
00:04:28,759 --> 00:04:29,920
Search every inch.

105
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,920
You hear me?

106
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:44,519
Boss.

107
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,000
Mr. Mai Gao.

108
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:49,800
We found this in the pig manure.

109
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:55,420
(AQ0824)

110
00:05:00,759 --> 00:05:01,600
Give it here.

111
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,800
That's it.

112
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,680
I remember years ago,

113
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:11,560
Boss Hai injured his brow

114
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,040
and had

115
00:05:13,279 --> 00:05:14,279
this metal plate put in.

116
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,040
Now we have proof.

117
00:05:17,399 --> 00:05:18,519
There's nothing more to say.

118
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:19,839
Impossible.

119
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:22,759
I didn't do it, and I won't admit to it.

120
00:05:25,639 --> 00:05:26,360
Hui.

121
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,439
Your memory's a little fuzzy.

122
00:05:29,959 --> 00:05:30,879
Let me refresh it.

123
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:32,759
That day,

124
00:05:33,439 --> 00:05:34,639
Nanhu Gang must've

125
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,319
let Boss Hai go.

126
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:37,839
Then

127
00:05:38,399 --> 00:05:40,040
you took him to the pig farm.

128
00:05:41,879 --> 00:05:42,680
Hui.

129
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:44,120
It was you.

130
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:45,240
Boss Hai.

131
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:47,639
You forced my hand.

132
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:49,600
You cut off my livelihood.

133
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,839
You wanted to expose my drug smuggling.

134
00:05:52,639 --> 00:05:54,160
How was I supposed to win the election?

135
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,399
Dongcheng Gang

136
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,079
won't let you get away with this.

137
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,480
No one will know it was me.

138
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:05,959
They'll think Nanhu Gang did it.

139
00:06:11,279 --> 00:06:12,480
Rest in peace.

140
00:06:23,439 --> 00:06:24,000
It was you.

141
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:27,519
Boss Hui.

142
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,120
Is this really what you want?

143
00:06:30,959 --> 00:06:32,240
My life isn't worth much.

144
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,399
But what about everyone else's?

145
00:07:09,959 --> 00:07:10,439
Lin.

146
00:07:10,759 --> 00:07:11,279
Che.

147
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,399
Take my wife

148
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,480
and Mei somewhere safe. Now.

149
00:07:18,519 --> 00:07:19,480
Come with us, Boss Hui.

150
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,319
Don't ask questions.

151
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:21,879
Just do it.

152
00:07:22,879 --> 00:07:23,680
Wait for my call.

153
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,079
Why?

154
00:07:26,319 --> 00:07:27,160
Go!

155
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:34,879
Behave yourself.

156
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,319
Boss Hai's death...

157
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,759
I did it.

158
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:10,560
Easy. Easy.

159
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,199
You're safe now.

160
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,079
It's all right.

161
00:08:13,439 --> 00:08:14,120
Mrs. Hui.

162
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:23,839
(Integrity)
(Boss Hui.)

163
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:25,800
(Your wife and daughter are safe.)

164
00:08:28,519 --> 00:08:29,000
(Boss Hui.)

165
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:38,919
Everyone, get out.

166
00:08:40,180 --> 00:08:42,700
♪I can't break through this wall♪

167
00:08:42,700 --> 00:08:45,620
♪There's no road ahead♪
(Keep Your Honor, Honor and Justice)

168
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:48,620
♪I've carried this weight all my life♪

169
00:08:48,620 --> 00:08:51,620
♪Dark currents churn beneath my feet♪
(Integrity/Be Loyal and Filial)

170
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:56,300
♪I spent my life standing by one man♪

171
00:08:56,300 --> 00:08:59,580
♪My blade is worn. Who'd even ask♪

172
00:09:00,519 --> 00:09:01,639
Your sacrifice

173
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:04,039
was worth it.

174
00:09:08,159 --> 00:09:09,120
I'll take care of Dongcheng.

175
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:10,559
Don't worry.

176
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:13,340
♪In the end, only my blade remains♪

177
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,120
Whatever we do,

178
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:19,559
heaven is watching.

179
00:09:21,759 --> 00:09:22,679
Remember this.

180
00:09:23,799 --> 00:09:25,039
Spare my wife and daughter,

181
00:09:26,039 --> 00:09:27,480
and my brothers too.

182
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:29,720
Please.

183
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:33,780
♪My final cut turns on myself♪

184
00:09:33,780 --> 00:09:37,420
♪This one last cut is mine alone♪

185
00:09:37,420 --> 00:09:41,020
♪I bear a lifetime of pain and regret♪

186
00:09:41,020 --> 00:09:43,980
♪Blade sheathed, the man is gone♪

187
00:09:43,980 --> 00:09:47,500
♪My final cut turns on myself♪

188
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:50,820
♪Who is listening? Who even cares♪

189
00:09:51,380 --> 00:09:52,924
♪Road's end♪
(Loyalty Hall)

190
00:09:52,925 --> 00:09:56,660
♪No fear, regret, no you♪

191
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:21,740
♪My final cut turns on myself♪

192
00:10:21,740 --> 00:10:25,500
♪This one last cut is mine alone♪

193
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:28,860
♪I bear a lifetime of pain and regret♪

194
00:10:28,860 --> 00:10:31,740
♪Blade sheathed, the man is gone♪

195
00:10:33,039 --> 00:10:36,120
I hope I can be like you someday.

196
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,000
Don't be stupid.

197
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:38,440
Why would you want to be like me?

198
00:10:38,759 --> 00:10:41,919
Everyone in Dongcheng Gang knows you.

199
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:43,360
I didn't get into this life

200
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,480
to have everyone know my name.

201
00:10:46,039 --> 00:10:46,639
Just remember:

202
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,039
In this line of work,

203
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:49,960
sooner or later, you pay the price.

204
00:10:50,879 --> 00:10:51,840
If that day ever comes...

205
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,320
Don't say that.

206
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,000
Boss Hui.

207
00:10:54,279 --> 00:10:55,360
I'm serious.

208
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,320
If that day really comes,

209
00:10:57,799 --> 00:10:59,039
my two blades,

210
00:10:59,759 --> 00:11:00,960
you each get one.

211
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:02,960
There is no "if."

212
00:11:03,879 --> 00:11:04,799
Enough of that.

213
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:05,679
Let's drink.

214
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:08,440
Cheers.

215
00:11:16,780 --> 00:11:19,420
♪My final cut turns on myself♪

216
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,720
Then we're good.

217
00:11:23,660 --> 00:11:26,940
♪I bear a lifetime of pain and regret♪

218
00:11:26,940 --> 00:11:29,940
♪Blade sheathed, the man is gone♪

219
00:11:30,260 --> 00:11:33,740
♪My final cut turns on myself♪

220
00:11:33,740 --> 00:11:37,060
♪Who is listening? Who even cares♪

221
00:11:37,060 --> 00:11:43,300
♪Road's end: no fear, regret, no you♪

222
00:11:43,300 --> 00:11:48,900
(Loyalty Hall)

223
00:12:30,919 --> 00:12:31,720
Boss Hui.

224
00:12:33,879 --> 00:12:35,240
We're here to see you off.

225
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,080
I swear

226
00:13:05,919 --> 00:13:07,320
I'll avenge you.

227
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:10,840
You...

228
00:13:12,159 --> 00:13:12,759
you've got guts.

229
00:13:18,759 --> 00:13:19,960
From now on, you're my top dog.

230
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:22,559
Everyone, listen up.

231
00:13:24,159 --> 00:13:24,799
From now on,

232
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:26,399
you answer to him.

233
00:13:27,559 --> 00:13:28,320
Call him Boss Lin.

234
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:31,799
Boss Lin.

235
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:35,200
Boss Lin.

236
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:40,460
(Dongcheng Tiger)

237
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:41,360
Boss Lin.

238
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:45,360
Thanks, Boss Hui.

239
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:47,879
That's my brother.

240
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:38,620
(Dongcheng Tiger)

241
00:14:52,559 --> 00:14:53,960
Everything Mrs. Hui asked us to pack

242
00:14:54,759 --> 00:14:55,919
is pretty much all here.

243
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,519
Anything else on your end?

244
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:25,559
Those stickers you gave me last time,

245
00:15:26,039 --> 00:15:26,840
do you have any more?

246
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,000
My daughter loves them.

247
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:30,360
These are my favorite stickers.

248
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:32,080
Thanks, Fu.

249
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:33,120
Boss Che, look.

250
00:15:36,559 --> 00:15:37,440
I can't believe

251
00:15:39,159 --> 00:15:40,159
Boss Hui kept this.

252
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,320
Boss Hui may seem careless,

253
00:15:44,279 --> 00:15:45,519
but he's deeply loyal to his people.

254
00:15:58,519 --> 00:15:59,840
What does it say?

255
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:01,940
(Lin, Che, Happy New Year...)

256
00:16:05,799 --> 00:16:07,200
It's a New Year's card from Boss Hui.

257
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,039
Read it to me.

258
00:16:15,159 --> 00:16:15,799
Lin.

259
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,039
Che.

260
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:19,919
Happy New Year.

261
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:23,399
This is our fifth New Year together.

262
00:16:27,399 --> 00:16:29,080
Time really flies.

263
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:33,080
I hope every New Year from now on,

264
00:16:33,919 --> 00:16:34,840
we'll still be together.

265
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:37,679
And lastly,

266
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:41,960
Happy New Year to you both.

267
00:16:42,919 --> 00:16:44,039
He even drew a picture.

268
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,600
New Year's still a long way off.

269
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:50,600
Why'd he get so sentimental?

270
00:17:11,039 --> 00:17:12,319
What do you want?

271
00:17:13,279 --> 00:17:15,480
Good evening, Mrs. Hui.

272
00:17:16,079 --> 00:17:16,920
What do you want?

273
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:17,640
Don't try anything.

274
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:19,519
I won't.

275
00:17:20,039 --> 00:17:21,079
I won't hurt you.

276
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:24,759
Mommy!

277
00:17:24,759 --> 00:17:25,319
Let go of me!

278
00:17:25,559 --> 00:17:25,920
Mommy!

279
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:26,480
Let me go!

280
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,960
Mommy!

281
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:33,519
Mommy! Mommy!

282
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,200
Don't cry.

283
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,640
Mommy!

284
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:39,039
Look, Mommy's flying.

285
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:41,880
Fly, fly!

286
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,119
Mommy!

287
00:17:43,119 --> 00:17:44,319
Can you fly?

288
00:17:44,319 --> 00:17:45,359
Mommy!

289
00:17:45,359 --> 00:17:45,960
Okay.

